  "bodyHash": "+0ZUhXeMOuA=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalbonemeal/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalbonemeal/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fFusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalbonemeal/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Универсальная костная мука заполняет все пробелы, где костная мука не может быть использована, но на самом деле должна быть! Все процессы роста довольно уникальны и зависят от растения. Новые механизмы также работают с диспенсерами и могут быть индивидуально отключены в конфигурации.</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalbonemeal/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalbonemeal/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalbonemeal/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalbonemeal/media/3.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalbonemeal/media/4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalbonemeal/media/5.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalbonemeal/media/6.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalbonemeal/media/7.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalbonemeal/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">УСТАНОВКА ОБЯЗАТЕЛЬНА НА КЛИЕНТЕ И ОБЯЗАТЕЛЬНА НА СЕРВЕРЕ</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">ТРЕБУЕТСЯ УСТАНОВИТЬ </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> (FABRIC и NEOFORGE)</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">ТРЕБУЕТСЯ УСТАНОВИТЬ </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> (FABRIC)</span></strong></p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">ТРЕБУЕТСЯ УСТАНОВИТЬ </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> (FABRIC)</span></strong></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalbonemeal/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Если мод поддерживает конфигурацию, её можно настроить прямо в игре с помощью меню модов (требуется </span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> от </span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fProspector\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">, установленного на Fabric). Обратите внимание, что для старых версий Minecraft также требуется установка </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Forge Config Screens</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Для ручной настройки с помощью внешнего текстового редактора все файлы находятся в </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px>, именуются как </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px>, </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px> или </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px>, в зависимости от типа конфигурации. Не все типы могут существовать для конкретного мода — возможно, их вообще нет.</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalbonemeal/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Спасибо </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/Forge_User_52183994\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Pifou</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> за вдохновение нескольких механик из их мода </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/improving-minecraft\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Improving Minecraft</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Спасибо </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/josephcsible\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Josephcsible</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> за вдохновение нескольких механик из их мода </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/expandedbonemeal\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">ExpandedBonemeal</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Спасибо </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/pepperoni__jabroni__\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Pepperoni Jabroni</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> за вдохновение механики кораллов из их мода </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/complete-bone-meal\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Complete Bone Meal</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Спасибо за вдохновение механики кустов сладких ягод из </span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.reddit.com%252fr%252fminecraftsuggestions%252fcomments%252fujh9bu%252fusing_bonemeal_on_taiga_grass_should_have_a%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">темы на Reddit</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">.</span></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalbonemeal/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/combat-nouveau\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/combatnouveau/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trading-post\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/tradingpost/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-shulker-boxes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-magic\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easymagic/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/overflowing-bars\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/magnum-torch\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/magnumtorch/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hang-glider\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/hangglider/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/straw-statues\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/strawstatues/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-animations-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/betteranimationscollection/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>  </td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-walls\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalwalls/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalbonemeal/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/universalbonemeal/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>",
